	rule_text:
		At the beginning of your upkeep, reveal the top card of your library and put it into your hand. If that card is <kw-a><nospellcheck><key>Historic</key></nospellcheck></kw-a>, ~ becomes prepared. You lose life equal to that card’s mana value. Then, as long as you have an Enduring story ↦ You gain life equal to twice its mana value.
		2/1
		\ W/BW/B
		Sorcery
		Storied <i-auto>(Expanded to work from Sorceries like City’s blessing does.)</i-auto>
		Create a <kw-a><nospellcheck><key>Blood toke<param-*s>n</param-*s></key></nospellcheck></kw-a>. As long as you have an Enduring Story ↦ Instead create two <u><kw-a><nospellcheck><key>Blood toke<param-*s>ns</u></param-*s></key></nospellcheck></kw-a> and two <u><kw-a><nospellcheck><key>Food toke<param-*s>ns</u></param-*s></key></nospellcheck></kw-a>.
